WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.663
Unit twenty-two. Step-by-Step Instructions!

2
00:00:05.598 --> 00:00:10.006
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.056 --> 00:00:12.909
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:17.226
Today we learn about Step-by-Step Instructions. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.089 --> 00:00:23.082
Steps. Say it with me. Steps!

6
00:00:26.596 --> 00:00:30.296
Order. Say it with me. Order!

7
00:00:33.763 --> 00:00:37.617
First. Say it with me. First!

8
00:00:41.115 --> 00:00:45.015
Next. Say it with me. Next!

9
00:00:48.532 --> 00:00:52.498
Last. Say it with me. Last!

10
00:00:55.994 --> 00:01:00.994
Instructions. Say it with me. Instructions!

11
00:01:04.489 --> 00:01:07.956
Follow. Say it with me. Follow!

12
00:01:11.489 --> 00:01:15.672
Algorithm. Say it with me. Algorithm!

13
00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:31.249
Instructions tell us what to do in the right order. First I do one step, next another, and last the final step. A list of steps like this is called an algorithm.

14
00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:34.487
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.206 --> 00:01:40.583
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:41.783
First!

17
00:01:42.805 --> 00:01:48.189
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.239 --> 00:01:49.389
Follow!

19
00:01:50.395 --> 00:01:58.016
Did you know? Computers can only follow instructions exactly, so the order of the steps matters a lot!

20
00:01:58.066 --> 00:02:00.520
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:01.373 --> 00:02:09.798
Think and answer. What are the steps for brushing your teeth?

22
00:02:09.848 --> 00:02:10.998
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.053 --> 00:02:17.358
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:17.408 --> 00:02:20.472
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

